 triage:action "Add the eight governing ADR IDs to the C4 adrs list and retain their actual checks; no new ADR or relaxation is required." ;
 triage:source_fix "Added the eight specifically applicable existing ADR IDs to authoritative C4 frontmatter; no new architecture decision or release exception." ;
